    "problemName": "maximum-frequency-stack",
    "language": "python3",
    "code": "class FreqStack:\r\n    def __init__(self):\r\n        self.cnt = defaultdict(int)\r\n        self.q = []\r\n        self.ts = 0\r\n\r\n    def push(self, val: int) -> None:\r\n        self.ts += 1\r\n        self.cnt[val] += 1\r\n        heappush(self.q, (-self.cnt[val], -self.ts, val))\r\n\r\n    def pop(self) -> int:\r\n        val = heappop(self.q)[2]\r\n        self.cnt[val] -= 1\r\n        return val\r\n\r\n\r\n# Your FreqStack object will be instantiated and called as such:\r\n# obj = FreqStack()\r\n# obj.push(val)\r\n# param_2 = obj.pop()",
